  "details": "Hello,\n\nI would be great to have a navtive solution which allowes to place Items in the world that can be interaced by other players.\n\nI know there are some solutions out there, but these are not really scaleable and requiere many contact receivers and constraints.\n\nhaving more then one of these will lead to an inflation of Scripts on a avatar.\n\nThere could be a native VRC Script like \"Avatar World Item\"\n\nThis can then used for:\n\n* droping a item in the world\n\n* Other players can interact/grab it",
